{"pages":[{"index":0,"markdown":"Photo - Jan 2025\n\n# RAW BAR\n\nCOASTAL OYSTERS (6) DF, GF 28\n\nchilled with cocktail sauce | mignonette\n\nSHRIMP COCKTAIL DF, GF 25\n\nchili cocktail sauce | lemon\n\nHAMACHI CRUDO* DF, GF 29\n\njalapeño | coconut | lime\n\nCAVIAR SERVICE & TOASTED BRIOCHE MP\n\ntraditional accoutrements\n\nHALF MAINE LOBSTER TAIL 35\n\nchilled or grilled\n\nTAYLOR BAY SCALLOP CEVICHE 28\n\nyuzu | lychee | lavender | lime\n\n# STARTERS\n\nSTEAK TARTARE 27\n\ntruffle toast\n\nCHICKEN TENDERS 24\n\nranch | sweet bbq add\n\nCRAB CAKE 39\n\nmasa cracker | corn relish | smoked tomato butter\n\nCHARRED MOROCCAN BEET v 24\n\ncucumber yogurt | pistachio dukkah | burnt citrus\n\n# SALADS\n\nLITTLE GEM CAESAR 19\n\nrustio house-made croutons | parmigiano reggiano\n\nPEARS & GORGONZOLA 20\n\nhoney vinaigrette | pickled shallots | walnuts\n\nSHAVED BRUSSEL SPROUTS 21\n\ntoasted hazelnuts | crushed red grapes | aged gouda\n\nWARM BURRATA\n\ncocoon tomatoes | jesper toasted focacia | fresh basil\n\n# GUEST HOUSE\n\nSOCIAL DINING & WINE GARDEN\n\n# SEAFOOD PLATEAU*\n\nchilled or warm / shrimp | maine lobster | king crab\n\nroasted bay scallops | oysters | clams\n\nFOR TWO • 150 - FOR THREE OR MORE • 280\n\n# BUTCHER'S BEST\n\nPRIME TOMAHAWK* DF, DF 6.50 PER OZ\n\nthyme | peppercorn | brown sugar\n\n40-DAY DRY AGED BONE-IN RIBEYE* 20 OZ GF 145\n\nroasted carrot\n\nPARMESAN-CRUSTED FILET* 7 OZ / 10 OZ 65 / 85\n\nroasted allium | veal reduction\n\nBUTCHER'S CUT* GF 63\n\nblack pepper | black garlic | charred broccolini\n\nMISHIMA RESERVE WAGYU NEW YORK* GF 155\n\nshishito peppers | smoked butter | sea salt\n\n# ENHANCEMENTS\n\nFOIE GRAS 26 KING CRAB 48\n\nFRESH SHAVED TRUFFLES (5c) 30 BUTTERED LUMP CRAB 28\n\nBLACK TRUFFLE BUTTER 9 MEXICAN WHITE SHRIMP 7 EA\n\nHALF LOBSTER TAIL 35 OSETRA CAVIAR (3c) 20\n\nCHIMICHURRI 5 BEARNAISE 5\n\nHORSERADISH CRÈME 5 GH STEAK SAUCE 5\n\nThis menu is a testament to the creativity and passion of our culinary team. Led By:\n\nTODD MARK MILLER\n\nCORPORATE CHEF\n\nCHRIS GILLESPIE\n\nEXECUTIVE CHEF\n\nMICHELLE RODRIGUEZ\n\nMAINE SPEC CHEF\n\n# ENTREES\n\nCACIO E PEPE v 32\n\nblack pepper | parmesan | + add fresh truffle MP\n\nSPICY RIGATONI 34\n\npancetta | calabrian chili | house-made pomodoro\n\nBRAISED SHORT-RIB GF 48\n\ncarrots | onion roast | pea shoots\n\nORGANIC CHICKEN A LA RAJ 38\n\nlacinato kale | parmesan | toasted pistachio pesto\n\nFAROE ISLAND SALMON GF 42\n\nbeech mushrooms | ponzu brown butter\n\nNEEV'S CAULIFLOWER 32\n\ngolden sultanas | pea tendrils | meyer lemon yogurt\n\nFREE RANGE DUROC PORK CHOP GF 48\n\nheirloom apple butter | braised kale | bbq lentils\n\nAUSTRALIAN LAMB CHOPS 65\n\neggplant caponata | natural jus\n\n# SIDES\n\nCHARRED BRUSSELS V, GF 14 GH MAC | N | CHEESE\n\nMISO MUSHROOMS 15 PARMESAN TRUFFLE FRIES 16\n\nSWEET CORN PUDDING V 15 GRILLED BROCCOLINI 19\n\nYUKON POTATO PUREE V 14 ROASTED ASPARAGUS 18\n\nConsuming raw or undercooked meats, poultry, seafood, shellfish, or eggs may increase your risk of foodborne illness, especially if you have certain medical conditions.\n\nV=vegetarian • GF=gluten free • DF=dairy free","images":[],"tables":[],"hyperlinks":[],"header":null,"footer":null,"dimensions":{"dpi":200,"height":1580,"width":2606},"confidence_scores":null,"blocks":[{"top_left_x":81,"top_left_y":8,"bottom_right_x":222,"bottom_right_y":32,"content":"Photo - Jan 2025","confidence_scores":null,"type":"header"},{"top_left_x":201,"top_left_y":157,"bottom_right_x":391,"bottom_right_y":199,"content":"# RAW BAR","confidence_scores":null,"type":"title"},{"top_left_x":196,"top_left_y":234,"bottom_right_x":923,"bottom_right_y":264,"content":"COASTAL OYSTERS (6) DF, GF 28","confidence_scores":null,"type":"text"},{"top_left_x":198,"top_left_y":266,"bottom_right_x":569,"bottom_right_y":291,"content":"chilled with cocktail sauce | mignonette","confidence_scores":null,"type":"text"},{"top_left_x":196,"top_left_y":307,"bottom_right_x":923,"bottom_right_y":334,"content"